!docs/99.sdt/art/test-results/F-CORE-DB-RESOLUTION-SSOT/*.md
# DD04 quality-result report referenced by evidence-dd04.json's linked_artifacts;
# without this it never survives a fresh checkout/CI, so the governance compute's
# requires_linked_artifact check always finds it absent and forces status=missing
# even when the underlying test counts pass.
!docs/99.sdt/art/test-results/F-MCP-OAUTH-AUTHORIZATION/dd04-quality-result.md
# DD01/DD02/DD03 quality-result reports referenced by evidence-dd01/02/03.json's
# linked_artifacts — same rationale as the DD04 line above.
!docs/99.sdt/art/test-results/F-MCP-RESPONSE-ENVELOPE/dd01-quality-result.md
!docs/99.sdt/art/test-results/F-MCP-RESPONSE-ENVELOPE/dd02-quality-result.md
!docs/99.sdt/art/test-results/F-MCP-RESPONSE-ENVELOPE/dd03-quality-result.md
# Real coverage.c0/c1 measurement referenced by evidence-dd01/02/03.json's
# coverage.c0/c1.result_path — same rationale as the lines above.
!docs/99.sdt/art/test-results/F-MCP-RESPONSE-ENVELOPE/coverage-response-envelope-20260818.json
!docs/99.sdt/art/test-results/F-COCKPIT-GOVERNANCE/coverage-frontend-20260818.json

